<title>GREECE: NATIONAL BANK CALLS SHAREHOLDERS MEETING MAR 14.</title>
<headline>NATIONAL BANK CALLS SHAREHOLDERS MEETING MAR 14.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>State National Bank of Greece said its extraordinary shareholders meeting will take place on Friday March 14 at 13:00 local.</p>
<p>&quot;Shareholders may vote in person or by proxy,&quot; the bank said. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
